  "abstract": "This experiment is the Phase 3 ablation study of the SOTA Fourier Forecaster. It removes the time-domain Residual Copy Head from the architecture (ID 335), leaving only the frequency-domain forecasting branch. The goal is to quantify the contribution of the RC head and understand the performance of the pure Fourier-based model in isolation. This is the final experiment planned for the publication of this new paradigm.",
  "submitted_tick": 162,
  "no_debugger": false,
  "cpu_only": false,
  "original_submission": {
    "content": "import sys\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\nsys.path.append('storage/episteme')\nfrom fourier_forecaster_v3_ablation import FourierForecasterAblation\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return { 'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32 }\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.model = FourierForecasterAblation(rank_k=hparams['rank_k'], proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'])\n        self.needs_rng = True\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init({'params': rng_key, 'dropout': rng_key}, dummy_input)\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n",
